    "shift": "shift_1"
  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A resistance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected to a source of alternating current rated <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>. Find the time taken by the current to change from its maximum value to the rms value :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The current in AC is of the form of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi></math>. The maximum current is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and rms current is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>. The change in the phase when current change from maximum to rms value is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi></math>. Therefore, the time taken for the same will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ms</mi></math>.</p>"
  }
}